			"notes": "For BTA 7.3_04\n\nA mail system has appeared!\n\nNew commands:\n- `/mail`\n- `/draft`\n\nNew configuration options: \n- `Sounds.TeleportSound`\n- `Sounds.TPANotificationSound`\n- `Sounds.MailNotificationSound`\n- `Sounds.MutedSound`\n\nChanged `/rules` and `/info` to allow strings as well as integers for the parameters so things like `InfoGreen.txt` can be opened with `/info green`\n\n\n## What's Changed\n* 1.1.2 by @camoweed in https://github.com/preprocessor/BetterThanEssentials/pull/1\n\n## New Contributors\n* @camoweed made their first contribution in https://github.com/preprocessor/BetterThanEssentials/pull/1\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/preprocessor/BetterThanEssentials/compare/1.1.1...1.2.0"
		},
